    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp; is unimodular.&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Squaring both the sides, we get,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mn>2z</mn><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>1&#160;</mn></msub><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1&#160;</mn></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1&#160;</mn></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>1&#160;</mn></msub><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2&#160;</mn></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2&#160;</mn></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2&#160;</mn></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is not unimodular<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;Point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> lies on a circle of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>.</p>"
